---
// Shared site footer — used by the dashboard and every article page.
const link = "underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-ink";
---

<footer class="border-t border-rule py-10 text-xs leading-relaxed text-faint">
  <p>
    A scenario model, not a prediction. Figures from EIA weekly and monthly reports, the IEA Oil
    Market Report, GEF, PortWatch/Kpler, CENTCOM statements and news sources as logged in the
    daily research pages — unverified items are flagged there and never promoted here without
    verification. Hollow chart markers mark a source's rounded estimate.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1">
    <a class={link} href="/">Dashboard</a>
    <a class={link} href="/model">Model</a>
  </p>
  <!-- The Astro compiler strips whitespace between text and tag boundaries, so spaces around the links below are written inline, not on separate lines. -->
  <p class="mt-3">© 2026. A <a class={link} href="https://www.mattcone.com">Matt Cone</a> project. <a class={link} rel="license" href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>. Made with 🌶️ in <a class={link} href="https://www.newmexico.org/">New Mexico</a>. Built with a local AI (Qwen 3.8-27b), running on an HP Omen 30L (RTX 3090) in my office.</p>
</footer>
